  "limits": [
    "These are approximate 16-bit effective-vertex observations, not extracted Dolby tables and not a complete measured lattice.",
    "Darkening-trim supplements improve coverage but do not establish internal table contents; supplemental observations are empirical and only fill coordinates absent from the neutral-first tables.",
    "Overlapping neutral/dark pair quantized estimates differed by up to the per-target recorded code deltas; these are empirical modeling/float discrepancies, not proof that any estimate is an extracted internal vertex.",
    "Vertices without exported observations remain analytic at runtime.",
    "Only target minimum 0.005 nits is represented in these tables; the separate 600-nit minimum-zero experiment cannot establish minimum-black independence. Runtime selection is restricted to exact minimum 0.005 nits."
  ],
